TC__FM__Category_alarms__cells_affected_cannot_be_determined
    [Documentation]
    ...  [CASE LINK]: https://jira3.ext.net.nokia.com/browse/TAT-20225
    ...
    ...  *****************
    ...  Basic information
    ...  *****************
    ...  The purpose of this test is to check when the cells affected by the fault cannot be determined,
    ...  faulty_cells and degraded_cells are not reported. Instead, affected_cells is reported as "unknown".
    ...  Fault will be generated by performing delta recommissioning of parameter x2LinkLock from unlocked to locked.
    ...  Appropriate field of impactedCells will be checked for :
    ...  Alarm 7107 BASE STATION CONNECTIVITY PROBLEM with fault ID 7300 No X2 link available
    ...  Alarm 7107 BASE STATION CONNECTIVITY PROBLEM with fault ID 6327 Setup of X2 connectivity to gNB failed
    ...  ******************
