    Step 1: Check All Required States
    Step 2: Provoke Fault By Performing Recommisioning
    Step 3: Verify Alarm Impacted Cells
    Step 4: Return Commissioning To Original State


Step 1: Check All Required States
    [Documentation]  In this step specific states will be checked.
    Log  \nStep 1: Check All Required States.    console=${TRUE}

    Log  Get MRBTS ID from configuration.  console=${TRUE}
    ${software}    Get Software Info
    ${active_sw}   Get From Dictionary  ${software}  Active SW version
    ${sw_variant}  Fetch from left  ${active_sw}  _
    Set test variable  ${SW_VARIANT}  ${sw_variant}
    ${MRBTS}=   Infomodel Get Objects Parameter   /MRBTS-1/RAT-1/BTS_L-1  btsId
    Set Test Variable  ${MRBTS}
    ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}=  Get sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2 value from infomodel  sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2  ${MRBTS[0]}  ${MRBTS[0]}
    Set Test Variable  ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}

    ${lnadjgnb}=  Query Infomodel  get object //LNADJGNB_A-*  timeout=30
    Set Test Variable  ${NRBTSID}  ${lnadjgnb.adjGnbId}

    ${index_list}=  Create List
    ${lteenb_object}=  Query Infomodel  get list //LTEENB_A-*  timeout=30
    FOR  ${element}  IN  @{lteenb_object}
         ${index}=  Fetch From Right   ${element.dist_name}  LTEENB_A-
         Append To List  ${index_list}  ${index}
    END
    Set Test Variable  ${index_list}
    Check NR status  ${Enabled_}  Available


Step 2: Provoke Fault By Performing Recommisioning
    [Documentation]  In this step faults 7300 and 6327 will be provoked by changing x2LinkLock parameter from unlocked to locked.
    Log  \nStep 2: Provoke Fault By Performing Recommisioning.    console=${TRUE}

    Log  Delta will be created...  console=${TRUE}
    ${delta_id}  Set Variable  1
    Create Delta  ${delta_id}
    Log  Appending parameter updates to delta...  console=${TRUE}
    FOR  ${index}  IN  @{index_list}
         Append Parameter Update To Delta  MRBTS-${MRBTS[0]}/NRBTS-${NRBTSID}/LTEENB-${index}  x2LinkLock  locked  ${delta_id}
    END
    Get Delta  ${delta_id}
    Save Delta  ${BTS Files}/delta.json  delta_id=${delta_id}
    Log  Performing delta recommissioning...  console=${TRUE}
    ${COMMISSIONING_STATE}=  Run Keyword And Return Status  coam.Perform Delta Recommissioning  ${BTS Files}/delta.json
    ...  skip_parameter_relation_errors=True
    Remove Delta  ${delta_id}
    Set Test Variable  ${COMMISSIONING_STATE}

    Log  Test will sleep for ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}s to wait for fault.  console=${TRUE}
    Sleep  ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}s

    ${link_status}=  Run Keyword And Return Status  LTEENB link status  Unavailable
    Run Keyword If  ${link_status}
    ...  Log  x2LinkStatus is unavailable after lock [OK].  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg=x2LinkStatus is available after link break [NOK].


Step 3: Verify Alarm Impacted Cells
    [Documentation]  In this step impacted cells field will be checked in expected alarms.
    Log  \nStep 3: Verify Alarm Impacted Cells.    console=${TRUE}

    ${fault_7107}  Run keyword if  '${SW_VARIANT}' >= 'SBTS23R2'
    ...  Run Keyword And Return Status  Assert Alarm Active  parameters=alarmId=7114, faultId=7107,
    ...  faultName="Cell problem due to associated X2 links and/or NG links and/or E1 link unavailability", severity=Critical   timeout=120
    ${fault_7300}=  Run Keyword And Return Status  Assert Alarm Active
    ...   parameters=alarmId=7107, faultId=7300, faultName="No X2 link available", severity=Major   timeout=120
    ${fault_6327}=  Run Keyword And Return Status  Assert Alarm Active
    ...   parameters=alarmId=7107, faultId=6327, faultName="Setup of X2 connectivity to gNB failed", severity=Major   timeout=120

    Run keyword if  '${SW_VARIANT}' >= 'SBTS23R2' and ${fault_7107}
    ...  Log  Alarm 7114 with fault id 7107 occurred [OK].  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg=Alarm 7114 with fault id 7107 didn't occur [NOK].
    Run Keyword If    ${fault_7300}
    ...  Log  Alarm 7107 with fault id and name 7300 "No X2 link available" occurred [OK].  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg=Alarm 7107 with fault id and name 7300 "No X2 link available" didn't occur [NOK].
    Run Keyword If    ${fault_6327}
    ...  Log  Alarm 7107 with fault id and name 6327 "Setup of X2 connectivity to gNB failed" occurred [OK].  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg=Alarm 7107 with fault id and name 6327 "Setup of X2 connectivity to gNB failed" didn't occur [NOK].

    Log  Impacted cells field of alarm will be checked...  console=${TRUE}
    Check Impacted Cells Field  7107  7300  NR
    Check Impacted Cells Field  7107  6327  LTE
    Run keyword if  '${SW_VARIANT}' >= 'SBTS23R2'
    ...  Check affected cells  7114  7107  NR

    ${av_status}  Set variable if  '${SW_VARIANT}' >= 'SBTS23R2'  ${Failed_}  ${Offline_}
    ${cell_status}=  Run Keyword And Return Status  Assert Every    NRCEL    availabilityStatus=${av_status}  timeout=60
    Run Keyword If  ${cell_status}
    ...  Log  NR cells in configuration are degraded after link lock [OK].  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg=Cells status is incorect [NOK].

    Check links status  Available
    Check Cells Status  ${Enabled_}

Step 4: Return Commissioning To Original State
    [Documentation]  In this step, commissioning will be reverted to original state to clear fault.
    Log  \nStep 4: Return Commissioning To Original State.   console=${TRUE}

    ${delta_id_2}  Set Variable  1
    Create Delta  ${delta_id_2}
    FOR  ${index}  IN  @{index_list}
         Append Parameter Update To Delta  MRBTS-${MRBTS[0]}/NRBTS-${NRBTSID}/LTEENB-${index}  x2LinkLock  unlocked  ${delta_id_2}
    END
    Get Delta  ${delta_id_2}
    Save Delta  ${BTS Files}/delta2.json  delta_id=${delta_id_2}
    Log  Performing delta recommissioning...  console=${TRUE}
    coam.Perform Delta Recommissioning  ${BTS Files}/delta2.json  skip_parameter_relation_errors=True
    ${COMMISSIONING_STATE}  Set Variable  ${FALSE}
    Set Test Variable  ${COMMISSIONING_STATE}

    Log  Test will sleep for ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}s to wait for fault cancelling.  console=${TRUE}
    Sleep  ${sctpWaitTimeInitSeqRetryX2_ini}s

    Assert Alarm Inactive   parameters=alarmId=7107, faultId=7300, faultName="No X2 link available", severity=Major   timeout=120
    Assert Alarm Inactive   parameters=alarmId=7107, faultId=6327, faultName="Setup of X2 connectivity to gNB failed", severity=Major   timeout=120

    Log  Configuration will be checked ...     console=${TRUE}
    Check NR status  ${Enabled_}  Available
    Check links status  Available
    Check Cells Status  ${Enabled_}


Check Impacted Cells Field
    [Documentation]
    ...  This KW is created to check impacted cells field of given alarm.
    ...  *AUTHOR* laura.craciunel@nokia.com
    [Arguments]   ${alarm}  ${fault}  ${technology}

    ${active_alarms}  Assert Alarm Active  parameters=alarmId=${alarm}, faultId=${fault}  timeout=60
    FOR  ${item}  IN  @{active_alarms}
      Run keyword if  '${item}[faultId]'=='${fault}'
      ...  Run keywords  Set test variable  ${alarm_target}  ${item}  AND  Exit For Loop
    END
    Run Keyword If  '${alarm_target}[impactedCells]' == '${technology}: Unknown'
    ...  Log  Impacted cells field info of alarm ${alarm} with fault ${fault} is OK.  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Fail  msg= Alarm info is not correctlly filled [NOK].

Check affected cells
    [Arguments]   ${alarm}  ${fault}  ${technology}
    ${active_alarms}  Assert Alarm Active  parameters=alarmId=${alarm}, faultId=${fault}  timeout=60
    ${affected_cells}  Create list
    FOR  ${item}  IN  @{active_alarms}
      Run keyword if  '${item}[faultId]'=='${fault}'
      ...  Append to list  ${affected_cells}  ${item}[impactedCellsListCliInfo][0][${technology}][0][cellId]
    END
    ${status_list}  Run Keyword And Return Status  Should Not Be Empty  ${affected_cells}
    Run keyword if  ${status_list}
    ...  Log  Affected cells are by alarm with fault id ${fault}, are: ${affected_cells}.  console=${TRUE}
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Set Test Restriction  No cells affected by alarm with fault id: ${fault}.

Check Cells Status
    [Arguments]  ${operationalState}
    Run Keyword If  ${SCF_COUNT_WCDMA}
    ...  Assert Every    WNCEL    operationalState=${operationalState}  timeout=60
    Run Keyword If  ${SCF_COUNT_LTE}
    ...  Assert Every    LNCEL    operationalState=${operationalState}  timeout=60
    Run Keyword If  ${SCF_COUNT_GSM}
    ...  Assert Every    GNCEL    operationalState=${operationalState}  timeout=60


Check If Recommissioning Was Done
    [Documentation]  This KW is created to ensure recommissioning is performed when the test fails.
    Log  Check If Recommissioning Was Done...  console=${TRUE}
    Run Keyword If  ${COMMISSIONING_STATE}
    ...  Step 4: Return Commissioning To Original State


TC Setup
    Common Test Setup

TC Teardown
    Run Keywords    Check If Recommissioning Was Done    AND    Common Test Teardown
